  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T09:12:30.704220Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T09:19:06.192850Z",
  "totalBlocks": 12,
  "translatedBlocks": 12,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ee21554a3b9121a",
      "translationZh": "我一直在折腾我在 rtx 5080 16gb 上的 Qwen3.8:27b 配置。我正在用 llama.cpp 运行 nvfp4 版本的 qwen3.8:27b。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39274e59b8807ee7",
      "translationZh": "这样我能获得 48k 的上下文，速度约为 12t/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32be74785f351788",
      "translationZh": "我的问题是，pi.dev 无法在合适的时机压缩上下文，随后模型就会提前停止。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "845d5c890f1cde86",
      "translationZh": "pi install npm:max-context //这个根本没法正常工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2c00c72ed1db5b9",
      "translationZh": "pi install npm:pi-observational-memory //这个算是能用，我把它设成了达到阈值时压缩上下文。在比例设为 0.75 的情况下，它成功自动压缩了 4 次，但还是没能在该压缩的时候压缩，最终失败了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d8ae3354d4f5b7f",
      "translationZh": "pi install npm:pi-blackhole //看起来挺有希望，但完全没有压缩上下文，我不确定自己哪里设置错了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77b7ac5a6d718a12",
      "translationZh": "我看了 https://pi.dev/packages 页面，那里有很多插件，用于上下文管理、上下文压缩、记忆管理，或者兼顾这些功能。数量实在太多，我没法就这么一直随机尝试。其他 AI 非常不给力。Google、OpenAI、Copilot，全都在胡说八道。这些插件中有很多似乎是面向前沿模型管理的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dec2f18f950f09ae",
      "translationZh": "还有一点让我失望：压缩设置最好针对所使用的具体模型及其上下文窗口来调整，但 pi.dev 的内置工具在架构上把压缩设置与模型设置完全分开了。如果你经常切换模型，这似乎有点问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbc2900b0a529263",
      "translationZh": "我可能想像上面那样使用 qwen3.8，但不一定所有事情都用它。我还想根据自己的使用场景，使用 gemma、其他 qwen 模型等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "416022504544a28c",
      "translationZh": "我不想每换一个模型，都得在 pi.dev 中手动重新配置上下文设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65bd216f67b155f2",
      "translationZh": "大家有什么建议，尤其是对于那些因为我的显存不足而只能使用较小上下文窗口的模型？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5727bdf167718ea",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/darksteelsteed 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
